	// CardPaymentId With `payWith: "card"`: the `cardPaymentId` from an earlier `PAYMENT_REQUIRED`, once its `payUrl` has been paid (the card is then held). Send it with otherwise the same request; the hold is captured if the purchase succeeds and released if not.
