	// A cold search queries several marketplaces and can take a few seconds; results are cached for 10 minutes. Limited to 20 searches a minute per account (`RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED`). If a source cannot be reached, the others are still returned and `sourcesUnavailable` names it. Also accepts POST with the same fields in the body. Works with sandbox keys (the listings are real).
