	// **Nameservers:** the domain is switched to Porkbun nameservers if it isn't on them already; send `agreeToNameserverChange: true` to allow that.
	//
	// **By product:**
	// - **Secure Static Hosting** (`PIXIESECURESTATIC…`): setup can take a moment; if `status` is `PENDING`, poll `/hosting/get` until `ACTIVE`, then upload with `/hosting/deploy`.
	// - **Cloud for WordPress** (`CLOUDWORDPRESS…`): a managed WordPress site. Edit its content with `/hosting/wpRequest` and `/hosting/wpUploadMedia` (no WordPress password needed), or mint REST API credentials with `/hosting/createWpCredentials` for your own code; the file endpoints don't apply.
	// - **Link in Bio** (`PIXIELINKSM1` monthly, `PIXIELINKSY1` yearly): a paid page of links (1000 links and every feature). Over a free Link in Bio page (most .com domains registered at Porkbun have one) it upgrades the page and keeps its title, links and settings. For a free page, use `/linkinbio/create` instead. Edit the page with the `/linkinbio` endpoints.
	//
	// The free Link in Bio page and the free WordPress preview that come with a domain never block a purchase: the product you buy replaces them.
	//
	// The call can take 30 seconds or more while the site is set up; wait for it rather than retrying (an `Idempotency-Key` makes a retry safe). Supports `dryRun`. **Rate limit:** 10 purchases per account per hour (`dryRun` calls are free).
	//
	// Takes any type of body and a specified content type.
	//
	// Corresponds with POST /hosting/create/{domain} (the `HostingCreate` operationId).
