	// - `sortName` — `domain` / `tld` / `create_date` / `added_date` / `expire_date`
	//
	// Dates are `YYYY-MM-DD` or `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`, in UTC like every date in the response. `...After` includes the moment given; `...Before` excludes it.
	// - `sortDirection` — `asc` / `desc`
	//
	// Supports both GET (with header auth) and POST (with body or header auth). For multi-value `tlds` on GET, use bracket syntax: `?tlds[]=com&tlds[]=io`.
